# ESG UI/UX Elite Redesign — Complete Audit & Implementation Plan

## Executive Summary
This document provides a complete UI/UX audit, identifies prioritized problems, proposes a redesigned architecture targeting enterprise-grade quality, and delivers a page-by-page implementation roadmap. The goal: **Bloomberg-level ESG intelligence UI that wins a hackathon.**

---

