## STEP 2 — UI/UX Audit Report

### 2.1 Information Hierarchy — ⚠️ MODERATE

| Criterion | Status | Finding |
|---|---|---|
| ESG score immediately visible? | ✅ Yes | [ESGScoreCard](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/components/cards/ESGScoreCard.jsx#6-34) is first card on dashboard |
| Status comprehensible in <5s? | ⚠️ Partial | Score is visible, but **no risk level indicator** and **no trend delta** shown at glance |
| Certification readiness surfaced? | ❌ No | [CertificationsPage](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/pages/certifications/CertificationsPage.jsx#4-13) is an **empty stub** ("Coming Soon"). Readiness data only appears at wizard Step 3, not accessible from dashboard |

### 2.2 Cognitive Load — ⚠️ HIGH

| Problem | Severity | Location |
|---|---|---|
| Dashboard has 3 grid rows with 12 total elements in 73 LOC — dense but flat | Medium | [DashboardPage.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/pages/dashboard/DashboardPage.jsx) |
| No visual grouping or section headers on dashboard | High | Dashboard renders cards without semantic groupings |
| Inline style objects everywhere (500+ inline style declarations across codebase) | High | Every component |
| [SummaryStep.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/modules/assessment/steps/SummaryStep.jsx) is 149 LOC single render with 5 sections, no section components | High | Assessment Step 2 |
| [ResultsStep.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/modules/assessment/steps/ResultsStep.jsx) is 195 LOC single render — the densest file | Critical | Assessment Step 3 |

### 2.3 Decision Intelligence — ❌ MAJOR GAPS

The UI currently answers only 2 of 5 critical decision questions:

| Question | Answered? | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| What is our ESG status? | ✅ Yes | Overall score + category scores on dashboard |
| Why is this score the way it is? | ⚠️ Partially | Category breakdown exists, but no **driver attribution** (what specific inputs caused the score) |
| What is the risk? | ❌ No | `RiskIndicator` component exists but is **never used** anywhere |
| What should we fix first? | ⚠️ Partially | Roadmap exists in Step 3, but is **hardcoded** (not computed from actual gaps) |
| What certifications can we achieve? | ⚠️ Partially | Cert table in Step 3, but **CertificationsPage is empty**. No gap detail or missing-requirements breakdown |

### 2.4 Enterprise Trust Signal — ⚠️ NEEDS WORK

| Dimension | Grade | Comment |
|---|---|---|
| Typography | C+ | `system-ui,sans-serif` used everywhere. No heading hierarchy enforcement. `fontSize` values range from 10-26px with no scale system |
| Spacing | C | Raw pixel values (4, 8, 10, 12, 14, 16, 20, 22, 28, 40) used ad-hoc despite `spacing.js` existing |
| Color discipline | B- | Token system exists (`C.green`, `C.amber`) but `#00ff88` neon green is **too vibrant** for enterprise — reads as "gaming dashboard" not "Bloomberg terminal" |
| Card system | B | Consistent `borderRadius: 16, border: 1px solid` pattern, but no elevation/shadow hierarchy |
| Layout consistency | C+ | `maxWidth` varies (900 vs 1000 vs none). Padding inconsistent (22 vs 28 vs 40) |

**Verdict:** Feels like a polished **startup MVP**, not enterprise SaaS. The neon-green-on-black palette is visually striking but undermines institutional credibility.

### 2.5 Data Storytelling Flow — ❌ BROKEN

The ideal flow is: **Status → Diagnosis → Impact → Action → Outcome**

| Stage | Present? | Location |
|---|---|---|
| Status | ✅ | Dashboard score + categories |
| Diagnosis | ⚠️ Partial | Only in wizard Step 3 (strengths/gaps), and those are **hardcoded strings** |
| Impact | ❌ Missing | No "so what" layer — no monetary cost, no compliance risk quantification |
| Action | ⚠️ Partial | Roadmap in Step 3, but hardcoded and not prioritized by impact |
| Outcome | ❌ Missing | No "expected improvement" projections |

