## STEP 3 — Redesigned UI Architecture

### 🟩 Layer 1: ESG Command Center (Dashboard Top)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ESG SCORE (72)    │  12-Month Trend ▲  │  Risk: MODERATE  │ Cert │
│  ScoreRing + Badge │  TrendAreaChart    │  RiskIndicator    │ 3/8  │
│  ↕ vs last quarter │  with delta label  │  (newly wired)    │ready │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Changes required:**
- Add **risk level** computation based on score thresholds to dashboard
- Add **trend delta** ("↑ 4 pts from last quarter") to ESGScoreCard
- Add **certification readiness count** ("3 of 8 eligible") as a quick stat

