## STEP 4 — Design System Enforcement

### Spacing System (8px base)

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `xs` | 4px | Icon gaps, badge padding |
| `sm` | 8px | Inline element spacing |
| [md](file:///C:/Users/Shalvin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5f43237c-388c-45d7-a540-bc500d35d2ea/task.md) | 16px | Card internal padding, grid gaps |
| `lg` | 24px | Section spacing |
| `xl` | 32px | Page padding |
| `xxl` | 48px | Major section dividers |

### Typography Scale

| Token | Size | Weight | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| `display` | 28px | 800 | Page titles (H1) |
| `heading` | 20px | 700 | Section headers (H2) |
| `subheading` | 16px | 600 | Card titles (H3) |
| `body` | 14px | 400 | Body text |
| `caption` | 12px | 500 | Labels, metadata |
| `micro` | 10px | 600 | Badges, overline text |

### Enterprise Color Palette (Muted Refinement)

Replace the current neon palette with enterprise-muted tones:

| Current | Proposed | Token |
|---|---|---|
| `#00ff88` (neon green) | `#34d399` (emerald-400) | `primary` |
| `#060c11` (pure black) | `#0f172a` (slate-900) | `bg` |
| `rgba(255,255,255,0.038)` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)` | `surface` |
| `#fbbf24` (amber) | `#f59e0b` (amber-500) | `warning` |
| `#f87171` (rose) | `#ef4444` (red-500) | `danger` |
| `#a78bfa` (violet) | `#8b5cf6` (violet-500) | `accent` |
| `#38bdf8` (sky blue) | `#3b82f6` (blue-500) | `info` |

### Card System Rules
- All cards: `border-radius: 12px`, `border: 1px solid var(--border)`, `padding: 20px`
- Highlight cards (score): additional `border-color: var(--primary-dim)`
- No shadows by default; `shadow-sm` only on hover/interactive cards
- Section label always: `micro` size, `uppercase`, `letter-spacing: 1px`

### Chart Rules
- Maximum 1 chart per card
- Every chart must have a clear title label
- Prefer area/line charts for trends, bar charts for comparisons, radar for multi-dimensional
- No pie charts (low data-ink ratio)

