## STEP 6 — Problems Identified (Prioritized)

| # | Problem | Impact | Effort |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **CertificationsPage is empty** — the most valuable differentiator (cert readiness engine) is missing | 🔴 Critical | High |
| 2 | **RiskIndicator component never used** — risk is not surfaced anywhere | 🔴 Critical | Low |
| 3 | **Hardcoded insights** — strengths, gaps, roadmap in ResultsStep are static strings, not computed | 🟠 High | Medium |
| 4 | **No trend delta** — score trend exists as chart but there's no "+X from last period" indicator | 🟠 High | Low |
| 5 | **Neon green palette** undermines enterprise trust — reads as gaming, not institutional | 🟠 High | Low |
| 6 | **Inline styles everywhere** — 500+ declarations prevent consistency and slow re-rendering | 🟡 Medium | High |
| 7 | **Spacing/typography tokens exist but aren't used** — `spacing.js` and `typography.js` are dead imports | 🟡 Medium | Medium |
| 8 | **No action intelligence layer** — users see scores but get no prioritized "what to do" | 🟠 High | Medium |
| 9 | **Social (S) pillar absent** — ESG without "S" is incomplete for healthcare context | 🟡 Medium | High |
| 10 | **ResultsStep is 195 LOC monolith** — difficult to maintain and extend | 🟡 Medium | Medium |

---

## Top 10 High-Impact UI Improvements

1. **Build the Certification Readiness Engine page** with per-cert gap analysis, requirement checklists, and timeline roadmap
2. **Wire RiskIndicator into Command Center** — compute risk level from score thresholds and surface it prominently
3. **Add trend delta annotations** ("↑ 4 pts") to ESGScoreCard and category cards
4. **Replace neon green (`#00ff88`) with emerald (`#34d399`)** across all tokens for enterprise credibility
5. **Compute insights dynamically** — replace hardcoded strengths/gaps/roadmap with actual score-derived analysis
6. **Create ESG Triad section** on dashboard grouping E/S/G with sub-score breakdowns
7. **Add Action Intelligence panel** to dashboard showing top 3-5 prioritized improvement actions
8. **Enforce spacing/typography tokens** — systematic replacement of raw pixel values with theme tokens
9. **Break ResultsStep monolith** into 5 extracted sub-components (ScorePanel, CertTable, StrengthsGaps, Roadmap, PathwayVisualization)
10. **Add emissions visualization** — replace text-only EmissionsChart with stacked bar chart using Recharts

---

## Hackathon Winning Strategy Summary

### What judges look for → How we deliver it

| Judge Criteria | Our Advantage |
|---|---|
| **Instant comprehension** | Command Center top strip — score/risk/trend/cert in <5 seconds |
| **Domain expertise** | 8+ real certification frameworks (IGBC, LEED, ISO, NABH, GRI, BRSR, CDP, ISSB) |
| **Data intelligence density** | Computed gap analysis, not just score display — answer "why" and "what next" |
| **Enterprise feel** | Muted emerald palette, strict 8px grid, professional typography hierarchy |
| **Technical depth** | Pure function calculation engine, Zustand state management, modular architecture |
| **Storytelling** | Status → Diagnosis → Impact → Action → Outcome flow on every page |

### The killer differentiator:
> **Certification Readiness Engine** — No competitor shows per-certification gap analysis with missing-requirements checklists and auto-generated roadmaps. This single feature transforms the platform from "another dashboard" into an "ESG intelligence advisor."

