## Verification Plan

### Visual Verification
- Run `npm run dev` and navigate each page after changes
- Verify Command Center renders score, trend, risk, and cert count
- Verify CertificationsPage shows all 8 frameworks with gap details
- Verify colors have shifted from neon to enterprise-muted tones
- Verify spacing follows 8px grid system

### Build Verification
- Run `npm run build` — must complete with 0 errors
- Verify no console warnings about missing imports or unused variables

### Manual Verification (User)
- Navigate Login → Dashboard → Assessment Wizard (all 3 steps) → Dashboard
- Navigate to Certifications page — verify it's no longer an empty stub
- Confirm the UI "feels" enterprise-grade vs the previous neon-green gaming aesthetic
